      {
       "action": "highlight",
       "target": "op[0..=1]"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "say": {
      "en": "Second, optimal substructure: treat the merged pair as one character with their total frequency, and what remains is the same problem with one fewer character."
     },
     "do": [
      {
       "action": "highlight",
       "target": "op[2]"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "say": {
      "en": "So every merge stays on the path to an optimal tree, and Huffman's code is the best possible prefix code."
     },
     "do": [
      {
       "action": "highlight",
       "target": "op[3]"
      },
      {
       "action": "write",
       "target": "takeaway"
      },
      {
       "action": "replace",
       "target": "takeaway",
       "text": "O(n log n); optimal among prefix codes"
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
